pynextcloud-sync (0.1.11) stable; urgency=medium

  * Discover running application instances from the real per-user D-Bus
    sessions instead of relying on SUDO_UID during package upgrades.
  * Gracefully stop every detected instance, wait for active synchronization,
    and restart only the user sessions that were running before the upgrade.
  * Add an executable lifecycle regression test for upgrades where APT/dpkg
    does not propagate SUDO_UID.

 -- EduhCommerce <eduhcommerce@users.noreply.github.com>  Fri, 07 Aug 2026 23:59:00 -0300

pynextcloud-sync (0.1.10) stable; urgency=medium

  * Unlock GNOME Keyring through the native Secret Service prompt after a
    biometric desktop login.
  * Keep canceled unlocks in a dedicated keyring state and defer automatic
    triggers until the user explicitly retries.
  * Resume file synchronization and notify_push after a successful unlock.
  * Gracefully stop a running instance before interactive Debian upgrades and
    restart the updated application in the same desktop session.

 -- EduhCommerce <eduhcommerce@users.noreply.github.com>  Fri, 07 Aug 2026 23:45:00 -0300

